1
00:00:05,579 --> 00:00:10,773
Before anything goes near the machine, simulate it. Open the sign.

2
00:00:10,773 --> 00:00:16,649
Drilling runs first, then milling in list order. The cut-out is already last: new operations go in before it.

3
00:00:16,649 --> 00:00:21,175
Now Simulate. It plays the toolpaths in program order on a block of material.

4
00:00:21,175 --> 00:00:34,909
Play: the two holes first, then the pocket clears the recess, ring by ring.

5
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:41,844
Each operation is listed with its time. Click one to jump to it: the profile, last.

6
00:00:41,844 --> 00:00:46,647
The totals: how far it cuts, how much material comes out, the deepest cut.

7
00:00:46,647 --> 00:01:03,473
3D shows the finished part. Drag to turn it.

8
00:01:03,473 --> 00:01:10,569
The collision check looks for the shank, holder or rapids hitting the material.

9
00:01:10,569 --> 00:01:21,467
This checks our own toolpaths, not the machine. Simulate in woodWOP before cutting too.
